# Redirect nbviewer.org-style links: swap the domain and it just works.
# /github/* and /gist/* are answered by functions/ first (redirect for people, link preview for crawlers). The two
# rules below are a backup: they only run when no Function is invoked for the path, for example if the Functions
# deploy fails or the project fails open. Keep them in step with hashPathFor() in functions/_lib/preview.mjs.
/github/*           /#/github/:splat    302
/gist/:user/:id     /#/gist/:id         302
/gist/:id           /#/gist/:id         302
/url/*              /#/url/:splat       302
/urls/*             /#/urls/:splat      302
